Career Compass is a web-based decision support system for SHS career
guidance (Next.js, JavaScript, Tailwind, App Router, no backend beyond
static hosting).

HARD CONSTRAINTS — NEVER VIOLATE:
- No database, no login, no account system, no admin CMS.
- Data is either static JSON (data/items.json, data/courses.json) or
  session-only (React state / sessionStorage).
- Landing page compass = CSS/SVG + GSAP ScrollTrigger only, never 3D/Three.js.

If a request would require a database, authentication, or a 3D engine,
stop and flag it instead of implementing it.